   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAFOPHANU PROJECT FOR PLHIV IN KARAMOJAOCTOBER 2022-JUNE2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This emergency food relief project to save lives of the PLHIV in Karamoja region which is facing acute food insecurity. The food relief will provide nutritional support to mitigate severe effects of malnutrition and promote adherence to anti retro viral (ARVs) among PLHIV in the nine Districts of Karamoja region.</narrative>
